IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gsfda-waiver`

-- Good Samaritan Food Donation Act 2024, ss 2, 4 and 5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_good-samaritan-food-donation-act-2024.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a bakery giving chilled cakes to a food bank, with both warnings` MEANS Gift WITH
    `the giver is an entity` IS TRUE
    `given in the course of a business` IS TRUE
    `the thing given is food` IS TRUE
    `given for a charitable, benevolent or philanthropic purpose` IS TRUE
    `the giver received money or money's worth` IS FALSE
    `given between individuals as part of a personal relationship` IS FALSE
    `supplied with accommodation at a private residence in exchange for services or labour` IS FALSE
    `the food was not unsafe and not unsuitable when it left the giver` IS TRUE
    `the food became unsafe after it left the giver` IS FALSE
    `the food needed particular handling to stay safe and suitable` IS TRUE
    `who was told the handling requirements` IS `the direct recipient`
    `the food stayed safe and suitable only for a limited time` IS TRUE
    `who was told the time limit` IS `the direct recipient`
    `the giver took all reasonably practicable measures to comply with food safety and hygiene law` IS TRUE
    `the liability arose before section 4 commenced` IS FALSE

